{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：04:39 2026-10-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：04:39 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：04:39 2026-10-27 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb4a3287ee4f57a654fd9a93276563bc/2026-10/2026-10-26_20_05_56.png\"/><p>將軍澳景林邨發生墮樓事件。27日凌晨零時許，警方接獲途人報案，指一名男子倒臥景櫚樓對開，懷疑從高處墮下。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，證實36歲姓周男子已死亡。警方初步調查相信，事主從大廈一處梯間墮下，現場未有檢獲遺書，事件原因仍在調查，確實死因有待驗屍確定。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T21:00:25.582407+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T20:39:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T23:38:49.371249+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:24.107602+00:00","content_hash":"bf5c0ea3692d1bcc47c035783cba698ba100c5c7cc9030b8a9c1f1d075c04782","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}